     "field": "note",
     "from": null,
     "to": "Maker wiki checked 2026-11-28 (shared lite3/mini2S page): 270 x 150 x 180 mm default standing, 915 g, 16 DoF (12 leg joints + 4-DoF arm), 18650 2S 3800 mAh pack (28.12 Wh computed as 7.4 V x 3.8 Ah), 4.5 kg.cm magnetic-encoder servos with 0-360 deg range and 0.01 deg control resolution, Raspberry Pi CM5 4 GB with ESP32, silicone + ABS feet, supplied 8.4 V 4 A DC charger (USB-C charging is not allowed), about 2 hours runtime, Python and ROS development. Top speed and payload are not published. The maker has no separate mini2S product page on xgorobot.com (404); the wiki is the current source."
